{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1563235200, "end_date": 1563926399, "month_true_total": 143, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:52:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "54258255", "author": {"steamid": "76561198291890513", "personaname": "落雨声丶", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/eric9010/", "num_games_owned": 1693, "num_reviews": 138, "playtime_forever": 4376, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1553, "last_played": 1606508864, "avatar": "42d0fc8903ec366f76691e05a4b5451b2750247e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "无主之地模式，射爆虫子，还有很多小套路，就是白金游戏太费劲，肝帝游戏3级全职业黄金", "timestamp_created": 1563909631, "timestamp_updated": 1564674481, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54254190", "author": {"steamid": "76561198233664172", "personaname": "東雪蓮", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/c24009/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 592, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 589, "last_played": 1563891568, "avatar": "d20b0c24dd731036217e82c2614deeba43062712"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "失败惩罚太过分了，和朋友联机好不容易奋战了快一个小时完成了搜集，结果因为该死的风洞没有及时回到逃生舱任务就算失败？\n就不能改成超时扣钱吗？\n垃圾游戏，差评", "timestamp_created": 1563891381, "timestamp_updated": 1563892616, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.425143569707870483", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54205132", "author": {"steamid": "76561198314624033", "personaname": "枫川", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198314624033/", "num_games_owned": 1923, "num_reviews": 259, "playtime_forever": 89, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 89, "last_played": 1540721737, "avatar": "f2eca8d585fdc2d0d5e7abd8c22437506a89642c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1]多人合作PVE游戏，评分8/10，整体素质不错[/h1]\n\n游戏中玩家扮演矮人矿工一类的角色，去下到洞穴里完成各种任务 [strike]比如挖矿[/strike]，可选择多种职业，各个职业特点较突出，打法上也是提倡分工配合；枪械手感尚可，游戏过程的自由度还是比较高的；画风不怎么精致，更偏Q版画风，整体素质比较优秀\n\n主打联机的游戏，单刷非常无聊，游戏现在没什么人了，而且联机质量一般般，如果周围没人打这个游戏建议不要买了", "timestamp_created": 1563680547, "timestamp_updated": 1563680547, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54187273", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099548238", "personaname": "给我蓝胖两个面子", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198099548238/", "num_games_owned": 86, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 27897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6450, "last_played": 1768908123, "avatar": "ea09ecb26d879f6a39a36aa5c8f6aec9e596d57a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "总体来说是一款不错的游戏，和朋友开黑比较好玩， 但是缺点就是有时候有点BUG，而且更新太慢，职业4个，很快就玩腻了，需要更新新武器，新地图，新职业啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊。", "timestamp_created": 1563584164, "timestamp_updated": 1563584164, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54177921", "author": {"steamid": "76561198240115936", "personaname": "♥ Happy_Dog ♥", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198240115936/", "num_games_owned": 334, "num_reviews": 122, "playtime_forever": 20043, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3795, "last_played": 1765119180, "avatar": "902885a22681dcdae102163cbc852e7c42f4c93d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我是一名深岩银河集团的矿工，我很普通，日复一日，年复一年的坐着逃生舱直达地心深处，来复往返，炎热 寒冷 干燥 潮湿 辐射 密林 变化无常的生态环境和危机四伏的虫群就是我的家常便饭，有时我与虫群你死我活，有时我与史蒂夫出生入死，有时我和一面之缘的矿友在地下互相救助，有时却不得不在任务和队友之间做出选择；我见过太多的生死离别，我也见过太多的背信弃义，出发前的最后一个桶 最后一次浮空 最后一杯酒；凯旋而归的第一脚，第一次按钮，第一次与机器人开玩笑；我说不上来哪个更令我流连忘返，或许是点歌机前的即兴舞蹈，或许是再一次从医疗室的床上起来，或许是再喝不下的那一杯，又或者是我们当初一起冲到那窄小的升级台面前。\n不知道从什么时候开始，我没有了对黄金和矿物的那般执着，没有了对大自爆和无畏的恐惧，没有了对烂醉和油桶的乐此不疲，逐渐扩大的机舱却不再那般狭小时的温暖，我没再喊过那句口号，也没再和队友们举过杯，很难说是什么让我坚持到现在，也很难说我什么时候会倒在那下面。\n但当我看到一名队友倒在逃生舱之外被虫群围在中心时， 我便没有一丝动摇   因为我明白和坚信：“不是所有英雄都身披斗篷”\n\n我是一名深岩银河集团的矿工，我很普通，日复一日，年复一年...", "timestamp_created": 1563538596, "timestamp_updated": 1607969358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}